# An update sits behind the browser cache until the service worker and the
# manifest are refetched, so they are never served stale. Hashed assets never
# change, so a year is safe.
#
# The policy names both Clerk instances because preview and development builds
# sign in against clerk.accounts.dev while production uses clerk.crosstune.app.
# The script hash covers the inline theme script in index.html; headers.test.ts
# fails when the two drift. The pitch stage's AudioWorklet loads from a blob:
# URL and compiles WebAssembly, and worklets follow script-src, not
# worker-src. Recordings play from blob: URLs and move to and from R2 by fetch.
# Slippery-Hill files play in an audio element from their own origin, so media-src
# names it.
# The app is behind sign-in, so no response belongs in search results.
# HSTS is a zone setting, not a header here.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-aardl2G4h/yd8GWJZ7EC/KvyBItqAIW+gpto19X7Kxk=' blob: 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://clerk.crosstune.app https://*.clerk.accounts.dev https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.protect.clerk.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://img.clerk.com; media-src 'self' blob: https://www.slippery-hill.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' https://clerk.crosstune.app https://*.clerk.accounts.dev https://*.protect.clerk.com:* https://clerk-telemetry.com https://*.r2.cloudflarestorage.com https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://open.spotify.com https://embed.music.apple.com https://embed.tidal.com https://w.soundcloud.com https://bandcamp.com https://archive.org https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.protect.clerk.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(self), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
